<view class="page support-page">
  <view class="support-hero">
    <view class="hero-kicker">一个入口，两类案件</view>
    <view class="hero-title">安全举报与客服处理</view>
    <view class="hero-copy">安全举报进入独立审核部门；订单、退款、隐私和一般问题进入客服队列。两类案件不会相互冒充。</view>
    <view class="hero-actions">
      <button class="hero-button" bindtap="toggleForm">{{formOpen ? '收起提交表单' : '提交新案件'}}</button>
      <button class="hero-link" bindtap="openSafetyCenter">查看安全边界</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card public-support-card">
    <view class="public-support-heading">
      <view>
        <view class="section-title">无需登录的客服渠道</view>
        <view class="public-support-copy">登录、协议或接口异常时，也可使用以下公示渠道联系平台。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="public-badge">公开兜底</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{publicInfoState === 'loading'}}" class="public-support-copy">正在读取公开客服信息…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{publicInfoState === 'error'}}" class="public-support-error">
      <view>{{publicInfoError}}</view>
      <button class="retry-button" bindtap="loadPublicInfo">重新读取公开渠道</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:else>
      <view class="public-operator">{{publicInfo.operatorName}}</view>
      <view class="public-meta">渠道：{{publicInfo.channel}}</view>
      <view class="public-meta">服务时间：{{publicInfo.serviceHours}}</view>
      <view class="public-meta">预计首次响应：{{publicInfo.expectedFirstResponseHours}} 小时内</view>
      <view class="public-actions">
        <button class="public-action" bindtap="callPublicSupport">拨打客服电话</button>
        <button class="public-action" bindtap="copyPublicSupportEmail">复制客服邮箱</button>
        <button wx:if="{{publicInfo.statusUrl}}" class="public-action" bindtap="copyPublicStatusUrl">复制服务状态页</button>
      </view>
      <view class="emergency-boundary">{{publicInfo.emergencyBoundary}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card wechat-complaint-card">
    <view class="wechat-complaint-heading"><text>微信支付投诉</text><text>入口边界</text></view>
    <view class="wechat-complaint-copy">正式发起入口在微信的「我 → 服务 → 钱包 → 账单」。找到对应支付后选择「对订单有疑惑」，并按微信页面提交。</view>
    <view class="wechat-complaint-boundary">这里创建的客服案件可以协助平台核对订单，但不等于微信支付投诉，也不会替你向微信提交。已关联的只读同步状态可在对应订单详情查看。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{paymentDisputeState === 'loading'}}" class="wechat-complaint-state">正在读取本人已关联的微信支付投诉状态…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{paymentDisputeState === 'error'}}" class="wechat-complaint-state wechat-complaint-error">
      <view>投诉状态暂时无法读取，这不代表没有投诉。请以微信账单为准并稍后重试。</view>
      <button class="wechat-complaint-retry" bindtap="load">重新读取投诉状态</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{paymentDisputeState === 'none'}}" class="wechat-complaint-state">暂未发现与本人订单关联的微信支付投诉状态。若已在微信发起但这里尚未显示，请以微信账单为准并稍后刷新。</view>
    <view wx:else class="wechat-complaint-list">
      <view class="wechat-complaint-item" wx:for="{{paymentDisputes}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="wechat-complaint-item-top">
          <text class="wechat-complaint-order">{{item.ownedOrderIds.length ? '本人关联订单 ' + item.ownedOrderIds.length + ' 个' : '订单关联中'}}</text>
          <text class="wechat-complaint-status wechat-complaint-{{item.tone}}">{{item.statusText}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="wechat-complaint-summary">{{item.summary}}</view>
        <view class="wechat-complaint-meta">{{item.responseLabel}}：{{item.responseText}}</view>
        <view class="wechat-complaint-meta">状态更新：{{item.updatedText}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.ownedOrderIds.length}}" class="wechat-complaint-owned-orders">
          <button
            wx:for="{{item.ownedOrderIds}}"
            wx:for-item="ownedOrderId"
            wx:key="*this"
            class="wechat-complaint-order-link"
            bindtap="openPaymentDisputeOrder"
            data-order-id="{{ownedOrderId}}"
          >查看本人订单 {{ownedOrderId}}</button>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="pagination-row">
        <button size="mini" disabled="{{paymentDisputePage <= 1}}" bindtap="previousPaymentDisputePage">上一页</button>
        <text>第 {{paymentDisputePage}} / {{paymentDisputeTotalPages}} 页 · 共 {{paymentDisputeTotal}} 条</text>
        <button size="mini" disabled="{{paymentDisputePage >= paymentDisputeTotalPages}}" bindtap="nextPaymentDisputePage">下一页</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{formOpen}}" class="card form-card">
    <view class="section-title">提交新案件</view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{categoryLabels}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="selectCategory">
      <view class="picker">类型：{{categoryLabels[categoryIndex]}}　›</view>
    </picker>
    <input wx:if="{{category !== 'safety'}}" class="form-input" value="{{subject}}" maxlength="120" placeholder="问题标题（2–120 字）" bindinput="setSubject" />
    <view wx:if="{{orderId}}" class="order-link">关联订单：{{orderId}}</view>
    <textarea class="form-textarea" value="{{body}}" maxlength="{{category === 'safety' ? 500 : 3000}}" placeholder="{{category === 'safety' ? '请说明发生了什么、当前是否仍有风险（5–500 字）' : '请说明发生了什么和希望平台核对的内容（5–3000 字）'}}" bindinput="setBody"></textarea>
    <view class="form-boundary">{{category === 'safety' ? '安全举报会进入独立审核，不在此处公开对方账号、内部规则或审核员信息。' : '客服案件不会自动取消订单、批准退款或改变支付状态。'}}</view>
    <button class="primary-button submit-button" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">{{category === 'safety' ? '提交安全举报' : '创建客服案件'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section-heading"><view class="section-title">我的处理记录</view><view class="section-hint">下拉刷新</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{partialWarning}}" class="partial-warning">{{partialWarning}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty compact">正在读取案件状态…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="empty compact">
    <view>{{error}}</view>
    <button class="retry-button" bindtap="load">重新读取案件</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!cases.length && !safetyCases.length}}" class="empty compact">还没有安全举报或客服案件。</view>
  <block wx:else>
  <view wx:if="{{safetyCases.length}}" class="section-heading"><view class="section-title">安全举报</view></view>
  <view wx:for="{{safetyCases}}" wx:key="id" class="case-card case-{{item.tone}}" bindtap="openCase" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-kind="safety" aria-role="button" aria-label="查看安全举报：{{item.title}}，状态 {{item.statusText}}" tabindex="0">
    <view class="case-top"><text class="case-kind">安全举报 · {{item.categoryText}}</text><text class="case-status">{{item.statusText}}</text></view>
    <view class="case-title">{{item.title}}</view>
    <view class="case-summary">{{item.summary}}</view>
    <view class="case-meta">更新：{{item.updatedText}}　查看详情 ›</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{safetyTotalPages > 1}}" class="pagination-row">
    <button size="mini" disabled="{{safetyPage <= 1}}" bindtap="previousSafetyPage">上一页</button>
    <text>安全举报第 {{safetyPage}} / {{safetyTotalPages}} 页 · 共 {{safetyTotal}} 条</text>
    <button size="mini" disabled="{{safetyPage >= safetyTotalPages}}" bindtap="nextSafetyPage">下一页</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{cases.length}}" class="section-heading"><view class="section-title">客服工单</view></view>
  <view class="case-card case-{{item.tone}}" wx:for="{{cases}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="openCase" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-kind="{{item.kind}}" aria-role="button" aria-label="查看客服案件：{{item.title}}，状态 {{item.statusText}}" tabindex="0">
    <view class="case-top"><text class="case-kind">{{item.kind === 'safety' ? '安全举报' : '客服案件'}} · {{item.categoryText}}</text><text class="case-status">{{item.statusText}}</text></view>
    <view class="case-title">{{item.title}}</view>
    <view class="case-summary">{{item.summary}}</view>
    <view class="case-meta">更新：{{item.updatedText}}　查看详情 ›</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{supportTotalPages > 1}}" class="pagination-row">
    <button size="mini" disabled="{{supportPage <= 1}}" bindtap="previousSupportPage">上一页</button>
    <text>客服工单第 {{supportPage}} / {{supportTotalPages}} 页 · 共 {{supportTotal}} 条</text>
    <button size="mini" disabled="{{supportPage >= supportTotalPages}}" bindtap="nextSupportPage">下一页</button>
  </view>
  </block>

  <view wx:if="{{communityReceipts.length}}" class="community-receipts">
    <view class="section-heading"><view class="section-title">广场举报收件回执</view></view>
    <view class="receipt-note">这里是最近 20 条摘要，只提供“已收到”回执，尚不等于独立审核案件结果。{{communityReceiptsTruncated ? '更多历史请进入广场继续按页查看。' : ''}}</view>
    <view wx:for="{{communityReceipts}}" wx:key="id" class="receipt-row">
      <text>回执 {{item.id}}</text><text>{{item.submittedAt}}</text>
    </view>
    <button class="community-button" bindtap="openCommunity">返回广场</button>
  </view>
</view>
